            <div xml:id="m-fc766e97-7fcc-4979-8b90-3bc51bdab95a">
              <lg xml:id="m-7f85e2f9-13dc-473d-a5f1-d0d83d18bbf4">
                <l xml:id="m-66f52f3b-682d-4933-928d-c94593b518ef" facs="#m-8e4a90b3-e839-4deb-b6a0-e244fd0b5624" label="ambiguous">1122.</l><l xml:id="m-f5c07f25-68e2-4dcf-9c3d-53d0944b6bbb" facs="#m-ec0bebe7-77b2-4987-adab-1b2c974ce28c" label="text-like">Common of Holy Popes.</l><l xml:id="m-f4539f4e-539b-4fcd-a1cd-11380d1e0c0b" facs="#m-8e3d2b4b-eade-4222-b956-7942dd39a566" label="lyrics-like">ni-am suscepísti me:"nec de-lectásti in-imí-cos mé¬ os</l><l xml:id="m-bcdf0add-de83-4033-ba0b-459c84792ee6" facs="#m-30874b7e-09bb-4c09-8810-1482c3294881" label="lyrics-like">super me. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-6aa00cc9-0f06-4ec5-9ba2-82e9f12a70cd" facs="#m-f3639f83-f463-4322-ad67-6f0f501e2fb8" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3e71726f-dda6-445e-8509-bf68047ae628" facs="#m-c53795ec-6f1f-44a5-a064-3716031a15b7" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, protectióne custódi;“quem totius</l><l xml:id="m-bbabf1f4-0418-4a84-afa0-7798f0ed1704" facs="#m-ee935dbe-4735-43f5-b8ba-aee79ca92ed8" label="lyrics-like">U placátus inténde: t et per</l><l xml:id="m-284b6def-b2b2-4172-a51b-8938caa19e76" facs="#m-8dd0a793-db5d-4587-aad2-0ef98bed7e75" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésiae praestitisti esse pastórem.</l><l xml:id="m-b52e519d-d778-4b2b-91ff-2e4d861f4d4c" facs="#m-02f987fb-58fa-42d2-806a-e43037d4b15f" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-14c3c9a5-cbd3-43ba-9e9a-202fd5f0c9d6" facs="#m-2120997b-e6ec-471a-8f32-2ec906ae6907" label="lyrics-like">beátum N. (Mártyrem tuum atque)</l><l xml:id="m-e1fb354b-d5db-4f4e-9b95-2ca7ee2373f5" facs="#m-8ebcf906-c347-4832-a1e7-24cdfb2fc34e" label="lyrics-like">Summum Pondficem, perpétua</l><l xml:id="m-369b5378-8e28-456c-bc13-cbab5e6b9574" facs="#m-4d8262e8-9afa-40f4-933c-186a8c2dd2b6" label="text-like">For Several Sovereign Pontiffs. Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-948c410f-0e34-4d76-9238-2ebdcf2d6e71" facs="#m-6e478b0a-53a8-43a4-8b86-55d55128ef7c" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne,l tectióne custódi;*quos totius</l><l xml:id="m-11d3a0c4-c63f-439b-9df5-dcf9c0ca7a76" facs="#m-78e2dc18-4cf0-496e-a4de-c21895f20603" label="lyrics-like">( placátus inténde: † et per beá¬</l><l xml:id="m-460f32f2-04dd-4019-a0b5-338f90184083" facs="#m-8f366d08-296c-4931-8f37-eabe1362e504" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésiae praestitisti este pastóres.</l><l xml:id="m-9271ce92-491c-4567-80d6-784f98f8646c" facs="#m-f12049da-4bfe-4dd5-b8ca-bc61d506287b" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-6d5b8819-00d3-4fa3-a4ca-e31b9eaeb956" facs="#m-888aaddc-f8d2-4fca-b959-67b71df2e696" label="lyrics-like">tos N. et N. (Mártvres tuos atque)</l><l xml:id="m-c4eed8d5-f2ff-4810-8cfc-bb9aed71450c" facs="#m-eca297a9-ad60-4fbd-a594-483f3c966d68" label="lyrics-like">Summos Pontífices, perpétua pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9a808f0-23b6-4e94-ac7e-4ae38373977e" facs="#m-5fb2b350-eeec-4d21-8525-dfdd3e2f5f53" label="text-like">If a Commemoration be made of another Sovereign Pontiff the followins</l><l xml:id="m-2f17c710-55f1-4812-93bc-84ac243343ac" facs="#m-6f3a3bac-47e5-42ae-a105-93e3e9536bcb" label="text-like">is said:</l><l xml:id="m-a6289015-8389-4504-ab4c-c5210b7c2e14" facs="#m-5e426452-7222-42d8-b473-9e3f00c757f0" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-b06915c7-4227-47a8-8517-333ae9a14302" facs="#m-ebc0c3e2-a37b-4905-915e-3aa584a859d4" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui Ecclésiam tuam in! (Mártyre tuo atque) Summo Pon¬</l><l xml:id="m-af43d3c9-cd23-4775-be45-6b328e8ca5c7" facs="#m-ef8df071-1e59-42a5-803b-e7505b9a5389" label="lyrics-like">U apostölicae petrae soliditáte ltifice, in tua veritáte persistens:"</l><l xml:id="m-91074acc-1ed0-4a40-b3a6-088c9b3bc0fe" facs="#m-3091ea4c-2c69-4b72-92da-ccf55d4f57ef" label="lyrics-like">fundátam, a infernárum éruis</l><l xml:id="m-4f902dc6-f9dd-462b-b3eb-48b406f96f23" facs="#m-7e2bd26d-fe5c-46e9-8993-ea7bf8197e0d" label="lyrics-like">contínua securitáte muniátur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-b72e20b8-3ec1-4abb-bb6d-57ab66d4cf4c" facs="#m-45f52071-7863-4db1-8805-d3321e413b86" label="lyrics-like">terróre portárum:t praesta, quaé-]Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1781e6d9-0fa4-4280-a12e-a2863c75323c" facs="#m-9e6eef21-18cf-44e5-9c77-058cf0542f38" label="lyrics-like">sumus, ut intercedénte beátõ N.</l><l xml:id="m-76ec7a51-12c9-47e4-a962-8b1e1df2b1d3" facs="#m-c4554588-8e7a-4d1f-a56a-13c8d129555e" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Petri Apostoli. I. Petr. 5, 1-4 et 10-II.</l><l xml:id="m-5ecadd66-ff79-4887-9630-bbaff533c159" facs="#m-9505848e-ea61-47e4-a3fd-b63cc3f3ef41" label="lyrics-like">vAríssimi: senióres, qui in vobis  ex ánimo. Et, cum apparúerit prin¬</l><l xml:id="m-3758eae3-c87d-49dc-a47b-0747ee8c1dcb" facs="#m-33de08c2-b95a-4cf9-ba79-6a287ffbcf3b" label="lyrics-like">sunt, óbsecro consénior et testis</l><l xml:id="m-9fde4b3c-c8e0-4791-b42a-07e3817626e1" facs="#m-e40d70b3-489d-44f6-8324-bdede6e13ce7" label="lyrics-like">ceps pastórum, percipiétis immar¬</l><l xml:id="m-940882e0-3649-47fa-bdcd-e4d3777032bf" facs="#m-6c953508-bfa1-4a36-aa58-47e089575521" label="lyrics-like">cescibilem glóriae corónam. Deus</l><l xml:id="m-35e4a4eb-1aec-4dfa-a4a6-f115b9129ef2" facs="#m-1b7cb67b-e0b3-47bc-934c-2619bf5841d7" label="lyrics-like">Christi passiónum, qui et ejus, quae</l><l xml:id="m-4772c914-9c49-4f1d-902d-fdaf4eb741ae" facs="#m-3a03c888-75e9-432e-89ad-c1f412507b0f" label="lyrics-like">in futuro revelánda est, glóriae</l><l xml:id="m-dae5b803-09ad-4096-8309-94fca3d2850c" facs="#m-dec9af65-abd1-4f4d-a38c-e683c79eace8" label="lyrics-like">autem omnis grátiae, qui vocávit</l><l xml:id="m-66176da0-b8e1-424f-86a5-59b246a7b1e9" facs="#m-389dd1bf-e7d2-4b4f-9ef2-fc77ea30f0db" label="lyrics-like">nos in aetérnam suam glóriam in</l><l xml:id="m-24896295-df00-4306-8442-472c7797d8fa" facs="#m-899505a2-b69a-4ff8-b017-07525e4a60f0" label="lyrics-like">communicátor: páscite qui in vobis</l><l xml:id="m-d0a7ed34-55fd-4f10-a912-2dcf074ef493" facs="#m-166059dc-43f4-47e1-be10-0d799344f751" label="lyrics-like">Christo Jesu, módicum passos ipse</l><l xml:id="m-26cb75c1-2db8-425a-b476-806ab5f0bdf5" facs="#m-5a63e6b1-49d5-422f-9213-e99a6038778f" label="lyrics-like">est gregem Dei, providéntes non</l><l xml:id="m-23a09d89-3db3-4992-8fe3-9404b4b3920c" facs="#m-4e4ee755-6acf-47af-ac13-3b12af7d36fa" label="lyrics-like">perficiet, confirmábit solidabitque.</l><l xml:id="m-d9404879-7a6d-4759-9727-756ef048484a" facs="#m-a58f58dc-c091-4f01-8f73-b2008fb34f33" label="lyrics-like">coâcte, sed spontânee secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-f2a8228c-03a6-423f-a8d3-92d1e5cb65be" facs="#m-5c9763ca-0e36-4faa-96d5-174ebe90a149" label="lyrics-like">Ipsi glória et impérium in saécula</l><l xml:id="m-08489e7f-7d72-404c-8365-620ce621570a" facs="#m-85f58393-09dc-4382-9d71-c87725f820e1" label="lyrics-like">Deum, neque turpis lucri grátia,</l><l xml:id="m-dcb3e987-2aef-4741-8722-5f4006fa2408" facs="#m-a64d96b1-38af-4eff-ab06-58b2310be92c" label="lyrics-like">sed voluntárie; neque ut dominán- saeculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-2e69c00a-203d-4596-b945-a5ec0124259d" facs="#m-ac652434-228d-4683-baff-983d68bcbe4a" label="ambiguous">tes in cleris, sed forma facti gregis</l><l xml:id="m-c57f0859-d910-4e98-9c39-f597790a6bf9" facs="#m-49fdce5d-01c2-422f-99f0-93403d5a1bec" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-2dba04e3-e530-4555-a051-3a84cdabff5e" facs="#m-11786357-fb43-44e1-a680-0ef7d7d8374b" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-28c1202f-e64a-461a-8609-453a74d49b0f" facs="#m-1fbdb0a6-d224-4bb6-9920-cdd8f7dd4edd" label="ambiguous">—</l><l xml:id="m-0f891b50-bc4e-4b07-9dcd-feba56d93523" facs="#m-d96c36d2-1675-4f26-a86f-2b4ef4bcf565" label="lyrics-like">in ecclé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b3921403-21d8-4715-9a4d-ba2b432b0bea" facs="#m-c1111f6b-3abe-4f1a-951e-c29b9707bd46" label="lyrics-like">X-ál-tent é¬</l><l xml:id="m-b87410fd-85b9-45c8-a34e-b66dc9104f4b" facs="#m-61283a3c-561a-40f0-8eaa-a7c470a090f9" label="ambiguous">um"</l><l xml:id="m-6b11ced2-332a-4244-95e7-1a926ea0489c" facs="#m-67fb52d3-b6ab-48d6-8144-1de602e5abb1" label="ambiguous">si¬ a</l></lg>
